run                   gradient
basis                 6-31g*
charge                0
spinmult              1
method                pbe0
precision             mixed
convthre              1e-06
maxit                 300
purify                false

cis                   yes
cisnumstates          3
cisguessvecs          5
cissubspace           5
cisconvtol            1e-05
cismaxiter            500

coordinates           coordinate.xyz
cisgradients          yes
ciscouplings          yes
cistransdipolederiv   yes
cisexcitonoverlap     yes
